title: "Activation function x normalisation strategy in nnU-Net for BraTS 2023 brain tumour segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Code, per-case validation metrics and training-cost benchmarks for a factorial
  study of activation functions and normalisation strategies in nnU-Net on the
  BraTS 2023 adult glioma cohort.
